---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profileUrl } from "../data/navigation";
import { path } from "../data/profile";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · zxxdev"
  description="From running systems and supporting users to building backend services and platforms."
>
  <article class="max-w-[42rem] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-violet">02</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-h1">About</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
      <p>
        I'm a computer engineer. I've spent years on the operations side: running systems,
        supporting users and building websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        That work teaches things tutorials don't: what actually breaks, what people need when
        something stops working, and what it costs to maintain what someone else left
        half-finished. Now I build software for those same problems: support workflows,
        deployments, observability and automation.
      </p>
      <p>
        The systems background shows in how I work. Before I call something done, I ask what
        happens when it fails, who will maintain it and how anyone can tell it works. That's why
        every project has tests, every important decision is written down, and every figure on this
        site is computed by CI.
      </p>
      <p>
        The code in these projects is written by AI agents under my direction. I decide what gets
        built, review every change and answer for every decision. Nothing reaches the main branch
        without passing tests and CI.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm certified in Azure: administration, networking and architecture. At home I run a small
        virtualization server where I test these projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section aria-labelledby="path-title" class="mt-14">
      <h2 id="path-title" class="text-h4 font-semibold tracking-tight">The path so far</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6">
        {
          path.map((stage, index) => (
            <li class="relative border-l border-border pb-8 pl-6 last:pb-0">
              <span
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="absolute top-2 -left-[5px] size-[9px] rounded-full bg-violet"
              />
              <p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</p>
              <h3 class="font-semibold">{stage.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-muted">{stage.summary}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-14">
      The way to reach me is <a href={profileUrl}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
